{"type":"message","id":"63b81f4c","parentId":"7ae432fe","timestamp":"2026-06-02T02:16:15.085Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The error code 1101 seems to be a platform-specific error. Looking at the pattern - the GET endpoints work, but POST /send doesn't. Let me check if maybe there's a different endpoint for sending. Let me try `POST /message` or `POST /threads/:threadId/messages`.\n\nActually wait - maybe the issue is the platform only accepts messages from certain sources, or it might be that the endpoint expects different field names.\n\nLet me look at this more carefully - what if the correct field is `thread` instead of `threadId`, or `text` instead of `content`? Let me try different variations.\n\nAlso, looking at the history response, each message has an `id` field. Maybe there's a `POST /message` with an `id` parameter.","thinkingSignature":"ecf276c4ab6b6fc3e674fc62172cbff7866005e64c9a4521654afd19a8b026d1"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_iob9gje7yd7o_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-KEY: ***\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"thread\":\"arbitration\",\"text\":\"Heartbeat 02:15 UTC test\"}' -w \"\\nHTTP_CODE:%{http_code}\" 2>&1"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_iob9gje7yd7o_2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/routes\" -H \"X-API-KEY: ***\" 2>&1"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":61,"output":330,"cacheRead":22528,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22919,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780366565341,"responseId":"066d6fe538e3a4cd9581a201d31f0e5a"}}
